483:             <h3>FerretDB</h3>
484:             <span class="killer-badge">SUBSTITUI: MongoDB Atlas ($ 60-$ 500/mês)</span>
485:             <span class="econ-badge">ECONOMIA: -$ 720 a $ 6.000 / ano</span>
486:             <span class="lic-badge">Apache-2.0</span>
